.TH UMASK 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
umask \- set the file creation mask
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/stat.h>
.B mode_t umask(mode_t mask);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets the process file mode creation mask to the low permission bits of mask.
The mask is inherited by children and retained across exec.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the previous mask; this call does not fail.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR creat (3crunch),
.BR open (3crunch),
.BR umask (2)
